# In two dimensions each pillar has more neighbours to lose light to: a coupling that is just below critical for a chain is well below it for a lattice kicked at one corner.
# Reference: the same network integrated independently (complex arithmetic, LSODA).
title Lattice of 5 by 5 with coupling 0.04
grid 5 5 kappa=0.04
kick 1 amplitude=2.5
run 1200
expect total 1
expect last 9.04620 0.003
expect count 1 1
expect arrival 1 9.04620 0.003
expect peak 1 60.504492 2e-4
expect count 2 0
expect count 6 0
expect count 25 0
expect total 1
